%% Sequence 09a — View public profile
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: viewer opens one standard public profile page.
%% Evidence status: Implemented; capability-dimension profile remains Planned.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor VIEWER as Viewer
    participant B as «boundary» Browser
    participant C as «boundary» ViewUserProfileController
    participant Q as «control» GetProfileViewPageQuery
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL
    participant R as «control» ReviewPublicApi

    VIEWER->>B: Open user profile
    activate B
    B->>C: GET /users/:userId/profile
    activate C
    C->>Q: execute(userId, currentUserId)
    activate Q
    par Profile and skill reads
        Q->>D: Read profile, skills and current spider data
        activate D
        D-->>Q: Profile, skill claims and governed rows
        deactivate D
    and Delivery and evidence reads
        Q->>D: Read delivery metrics, featured reviews, work history
        activate D
        D-->>Q: Current reportable evidence
        deactivate D
    and Reverse-review summary
        Q->>R: loadUserReverseReviewSummary(userId)
        activate R
        R-->>Q: Reverse-review summary
        deactivate R
    end
    Q-->>C: Profile page result and isOwnProfile
    deactivate Q
    C-->>B: Render profile/view
    deactivate C
    B-->>VIEWER: Show current visible profile
    deactivate B
